      en: ["Built in 1938.", "Served as parliament from 1938 to 1994.", "Main chamber capacity: 180 seats.", "Building has three floors.", "Converted to offices after 1994.", "Currently houses the National Archives of Malawi."],
      es: ["Construido en 1938", "Sede del parlamento de 1938 a 1994", "El salón de plenos tiene capacidad para 180 diputados", "El edificio tiene 3 plantas", "Utilizado para fines administrativos tras 1994", "Hoy alberga el Archivo Nacional de Malaui"],
