      hu: "A Likoma-szigeti rabszolga-menedékhely a malawi-tavi szigeten található. A sziget területe 18 km². A sziklák között barlangokban rejtőztek a szökevények. A sziget lakossága 6000 fő. A szigeten található a Szent Péter-székesegyház, amely 1905-ben épült. A rabszolga-menedékhely ma turisztikai látványosság.",
      ro: "Adăpostul pentru sclavi de pe insula Likoma este un sit istoric pe lacul Malawi. Insula are 18 km². Sclavii fugiți se ascundeau în peșteri. Populația insulei este de 6000. Catedrala Sf. Petru, construită în 1905, se află pe insulă. Adăpostul este acum o atracție turistică.",
      en: "Likoma Island Slave Refuge refers to caves and rock shelters used by escaped slaves in the 19th century. Likoma Island has an area of 18 km² and a population of 6000. The refuge sites are scattered along the rocky shoreline. St. Peter's Cathedral, built 1905, is also on the island. The slave trade ended in the 1890s. The sites are now touristic landmarks.",
